1
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:34,160
As Your Highness expected,

2
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:36,880
Tang Zhiluo indeed didn't take the antidote on time.

3
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:37,800
She also forced her inner energy

4
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:40,000
to expel the Gu worm for Yuwen Jingxuan.

5
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,130
I'm afraid she won't live much longer.

6
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:45,800
But with her death,

7
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:48,479
Your Highness will have to search for him privately again.

8
00:01:48,479 --> 00:01:50,340
I don't know when we will find him.

9
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,140
There is no need to search.

10
00:01:54,039 --> 00:01:56,170
Without the Soul Jade, Yuwen Jingxuan

11
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,850
won't last until Tang Zhiluo returns.

12
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,360
Yes.

13
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:05,010
The highest good is like water.

14
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:09,320
Water benefits all things and does not compete.

15
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,079
I was negligent in this matter.

16
00:02:17,079 --> 00:02:17,880
Jingxuan.

17
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:20,160
Yuwen Jia and the Shang family are sinister.

18
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,760
It has nothing to do with you.

19
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:25,260
I will go to the Shang family now to demand the antidote.

20
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:26,579
The doctor said

21
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,100
it's already too late.

22
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:57,720
You're awake.

23
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:07,100
Drink the medicine first.

24
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,360
How much time

25
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,200
do I have left?

26
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,600
Don't talk nonsense.

27
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:40,240
You don't have to hide it from me.

28
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:43,560
The Shang family has always used poison to control

29
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:46,280
those adopted daughters.

30
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:50,200
They must take the antidote every ten days.

31
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:53,440
I haven't taken the antidote for over ten days.

32
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:57,880
So how long do you think I can live?

33
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:01,560
Three days.

34
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:10,000
It seems I can't keep my promise.

35
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:12,600
Don't worry.

36
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,760
I won't let you die like this.

37
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:31,170
Why is Your Highness staring at me?

38
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:32,560
Xiyao.

39
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:36,240
Don't we look like an ordinary couple like this?

40
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:41,250
Does Your Highness no longer want the empire?

41
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,170
I was confused for a moment.

42
00:04:58,040 --> 00:05:00,440
Did Your Highness invite me to this banquet

43
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:02,320
just to embarrass me?

44
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:06,200
Am I not the one who is more embarrassed?

45
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,420
I won't argue with you.

46
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,040
Have a seat.

47
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:20,040
I invited you here today, Mr. Su,

48
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:22,160
to discuss an important matter.

49
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:25,040
Since I have chosen Prince Shuo,

50
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:27,240
I will never stand on your side.

51
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:33,700
What if Prince Shuo can't even protect himself?

52
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:34,680
What?

53
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:37,720
Are you going to drag the entire Su family

54
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,920
down with you, Mr. Su?

55
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,440
If that day really comes,

56
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:44,570
I hope Your Highness

57
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:47,340
won't implicate Xiyao because of me.

58
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,040
As for my woman,

59
00:05:55,159 --> 00:05:57,320
it's not your place to speak.

60
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:02,200
Your Highness is absolutely right.

61
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:24,880
Didn't Your Highness have matters to discuss?

62
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:27,240
Why are you back so early?

63
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:29,000
I finished my business,

64
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,160
so I came back early.

65
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:32,680
I see you took it off. Do you not like it?

66
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:36,080
I accidentally tore it, so...

67
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,240
It's fine. I'll just mend it.

68
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,780
I had the kitchen make some pastries.

69
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:06,320
Eat them first. Tomorrow we'll go to the Shang family.

70
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:10,610
What happened to your hand?

71
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:15,200
Ah, it's nothing.

72
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,440
This poison will penetrate the bone marrow

73
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:18,900
and seep out from the skin.

74
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:20,280
But don't worry.

75
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:22,880
It will only burn the skin and won't...

76
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:35,040
Do you think I'm worried about that?

77
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:39,640
I've never been afraid of death.

78
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:42,450
I'm even less afraid of dying with you.

79
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,040
But you said that

80
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,120
as long as there is a glimmer of hope,

81
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,560
we should fight for it.

82
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:51,760
I don't remember saying that.

83
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,200
But I remember.

84
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,680
Stop worrying, okay?

85
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:14,660
We'll go to the Shang family tonight,

86
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:15,800
okay?

87
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:21,410
Your Highness, Your Highness, don't be anxious.

88
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,940
How about this? Tomorrow,

89
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:25,290
we'll go to the Shang family together.

90
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:50,840
Why don't you want to die anymore?

91
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:52,280
Someone told me

92
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,600
that as long as there is a glimmer of hope,

93
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,060
one should strive to live.

94
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:04,920
Then I will give you another ten days.

95
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,730
Within ten days,

96
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:10,200
between you and Yuwen Jingxuan,

97
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,960
only one can survive.

98
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,280
I didn't agree.

99
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,120
I know.

100
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:50,010
Let's go back first.

101
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,760
I didn't agree to the Shang family's terms.

102
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:41,490
I just trusted my own judgment.

103
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:44,880
I don't think Your Highness is a wicked person,

104
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:48,530
and I don't want to help the Shang family do evil anymore.

105
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:54,180
So Your Highness really doesn't have to do this.

106
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,300
Do you really think

107
00:11:58,560 --> 00:12:00,960
I'm doing this because you showed me mercy?

108
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:06,580
Then Your Highness has even less reason to do so,

109
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:09,600
just because I look like an old friend of yours.

110
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:11,200
You really don't have to.
